| TT-KIT | Twin tray door-end sensor kit | EUR 215 |

Rebate notes: 2.5% from the 41st Unit and 4.0% from the 81st Unit, see Article 2.5. The marine coating package is not discounted.

## Annex B — Spare Parts tier discounts and lead times

| Tier | Annual Spare Parts Spend | Discount from list |
|---|---|---|
| Tier 1 | up to EUR 49,999 | 0% |
| Tier 2 | EUR 50,000 to EUR 149,999 | 7.5% |
| Tier 3 | EUR 150,000 to EUR 299,999 | 12% |
| Tier 4 | EUR 300,000 and above | 15.5% |

| Category | Shipping time | Examples |
|---|---|---|
| Category 1 | 2 Working Days | compressor, controller, fan motors |
| Category 2 | 5 Working Days | evaporator fins, defrost heaters |
| Category 3 | 15 Working Days | body panels, wear parts |

Note: the Supplier's first draft of Annex B had a fifth tier at EUR 500,000 with an 18% discount. This was dropped at the 17 August meeting because the Buyer will not realistically reach it, and so the top tier is Tier 4.

